SpinPolarized     F
FixSpin           F
NonCollinearSpin  F
DM.InitSpinAF     F
ON.UseSaveLWF     T
DM.UseSaveDM      F
UseSaveData       T
LongOutput        T
WriteCoorXmol     T
WriteCoorStep     T
WriteForces       T
SaveHS            T
XML.Write         T
